g 2 BHK of 660 sqft at ₹1.75 Cr. See the pricing table above.\n\nWho is the developer?\n\nH Rishabraj Developers — 3766 projects tracked on Mumbai Property Exchange. [View their track record ▸](/builder/h-rishabraj-developers)\n\nHow do I book or get more details?\n\nTap WhatsApp or Call below to speak with a Mumbai Property Exchange advisor — serving Mumbai since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017.\n\nSOURCE · MAHARERA + MUMBAI PROPERTY EXCHANGE  \nINDEPENDENT DATA · RERA A51800043517 · EST. 1995\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Rishabraj%20Anuja%20(RERA%20PR1180002501316))[Enquire ▸](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Rishabraj%20Anuja%20(RERA%20PR1180002501316))\n\n🎯 AI Matchmaker\n\nTell us what you want in Borivali West — get matched\n\nRERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.\n\n[New launch\n\nCodename Capital World, Thane West\n\nNew launch in Thane West — ₹14,382/sq.ft\n\nView project ›](/ad-click/900040)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![BMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/a5490eaafe8c.png)\n\nArticles\n\nBMC Begins Fresh Sea-Level Risk Assessment for Mumbai\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001930/bmc-begins-fresh-sea-level-risk-assessment-for-mumbai)[![MahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/499075ce4cdd.png)\n\nArticles\n\nMahaRERA Orders L&T to Fix Defects at Crescent Bay Parel\n\n📅 07 Sep 2026](/news/2001927/maharera-orders-l-t-to-fix-defects-at-crescent-bay-parel)[![GIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8d8e7c8b42a9.png)\n\nArticles\n\nGIS maps to be attached to sale deeds from October in Maharashtra\n\n📅 05 Sep 2026](/news/2001922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://newprojectsonline.com/blog/rishabraj-anuja-borivali","title":"H Rishabraj Anuja Borivali West | New Launch Residential | NewProjectsOnline","raw_content":"NewProjectsOnline - AI Property Recommendations +91-9137458691\n\nOffice No. 603, Plot No. 113B/C, Sector 50ENavi MumbaiMaharashtra400706\n\nAI Property Matching, Real Estate Investment, New Projects\n\n* [Post Requirement](https://newprojectsonline.com/postrequirements)\n* [Contact us](https://newprojectsonline.com/#contact)\n* [WhatsApp](https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=919137458691&text=Hi!%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20Buying%20Property%20in%20Navi%20Mumbai%20.%20Please%20connect%20with%20me)\n\n[![NewProjectsOnline](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/main/img/logos/logo.png)](https://newprojectsonline.com/)\n\n[![NewProjectsOnline](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/main/img/logos/logo.png)](https://newprojectsonline.com/)\n\n[Post  \nRequirement](https://newprojectsonline.com/postrequirements) [+91-9137-45-8691](tel:+91-9137-45-8691)\n\n# Rishabraj Anuja Borivali - Price, Floor Plans, Location & Investment Guide\n\n RESIDENTIAL \n\n•  5 min read\n\n![Rishabraj Anuja Borivali at Borivali West, Mumbai by H Rishabraj Group - residential project](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/uploads/banners/1770683302-rishabraj-anuja-project-borivali-west-mumbai-2.webp)\n\n### Key Takeaways\n\n* ✓ Rishabraj Anuja Borivali offers premium residential spaces\n* ✓ Developed by H Rishabraj Group\n* ✓ RERA approved\n* ✓ Excellent investment potential\n\nWelcome to our comprehensive guide on **Rishabraj Anuja Borivali**, an exceptional residential development located at **Borivali West, Mumbai**. In this detailed article, we'll explore everything you need to know about this prestigious residential project by **H Rishabraj Group**.\n\n**Quick Summary:** Rishabraj Anuja Borivali offers 1, 2, 2 + 2, 3 BHK with prices starting at ₹ 1.40 Cr - 2.93 Cr Onwards. The project is RERA approved and promises exceptional lifestyle amenities.\n\n**Interested in Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?** Get priority access to exclusive offers and detailed information.\n\n## Project Overview\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali is a residential project developed by H Rishabraj Group. Located at Borivali West, Mumbai, this project offers a perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience for modern living.\n\n**H Rishabraj Anuja** is a premium new launch residential project by H Rishabraj Developers located in the heart of **Borivali West, Western Mumbai**. Designed for modern urban living, the project offers thoughtfully planned homes in a well-connected and well-developed neighborhood. Spread across 0.25 acres, H Rishabraj Anuja features 2 residential towers with 6 floors, housing a total of 34 exclusive units.\n\nThe project is **RERA registered (PR1180002501316)**, ensuring complete transparency and buyer confidence. With possession scheduled for June 2028, H Rishabraj Anuja is an ideal choice for both homebuyers and investors seeking long-term value in Borivali West.\n\nLocation\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nProject Type\n\nPrice\n\n₹ 1.40 Cr - 2.93 Cr Onwards\n\nConfigurations \n\n1,2,2,3 BHK\n\n**Want detailed specifications?** Get complete project details, plot layouts, and pricing breakdown.\n\n## Pricing & Configuration Details\n\nUnderstanding the pricing structure is crucial when considering a home investment. At Rishabraj Anuja Borivali, you'll find a range of options to suit different family needs and budgets.\n\n### Available Configurations\n\n* **1 BHK:** Area: 435 – 455 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request\n* **2 BHK:** Area: 660 – 726 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request\n* **2 BHK + 2 BHK:** Area: On Request sq.ft. | Price: On Request\n* **3 BHK:** Area: 935 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request\n\n**Need custom pricing?** Get personalized cost breakdown and payment plans.\n\n## World-Class Lifestyle Amenities\n\nOne of the standout features of Rishabraj Anuja Borivali is its extensive range of amenities designed to enhance your lifestyle.\n\n* 24\\*7 Water Supply\n* Car Parking\n* Children’s Play Area\n* Gymnasium\n* High Speed Elevators\n* Indoor Games\n* Intercom Facility\n* Jogging track\n* Power Backup\n* Rain Water Harvesting\n* Security\n* Vastu Compliant\n* Video/CCTV Security\n* Yoga/Meditation Area\n\n**Want to experience the amenities firsthand?** Schedule a site visit.\n\n## Prime Location Advantages\n\nLocation is one of the most critical factors in real estate, and Rishabraj Anuja Borivali scores high on this aspect. Situated at Borivali West, Mumbai, the project offers excellent connectivity and access to essential services.\n\nExplore more [new projects in Borivali West](https://newprojectsonline.com/new-projects-in-Borivali-West) and upcoming residential developments in this location.\n\n### Key Location Highlights\n\nBorivali Railway Station - 5 mins\n\nShimpoli Metro Station - 6 mins\n\nS.V. Road - 2 mins\n\nLink Road - 3 mins\n\nEducational Institutes in Borivali - 5–10 mins\n\nHospitals & Healthcare Centres - 5–8 mins\n\nShopping & Lifestyle Hubs - 4–7 mins\n\nBanks & ATMs (ICICI, HDFC, Axis) - 2 mins\n\nReligious & Cultural Landmarks - 2–5 mins\n\n**Curious about the neighborhood?** Get detailed location analysis and connectivity information.\n\n## Thoughtful Floor Plans\n\nThe floor plans at Rishabraj Anuja Borivali are designed with modern living in mind, maximizing space utilization.\n\nThe project offers 3 different floor plan options to cater to various family sizes and preferences.\n\n### Available Floor Plans\n\n* **2 BHK:** Designed for optimal space utilization and comfort\n* **Floor Plan :** Designed for optimal space utilization and comfort\n* **Floor Plan :** Designed for optimal space utilization and comfort\n\n**Need detailed floor plans?** Get high‑resolution diagrams and site plan.\n\n## About the Builder: H Rishabraj Group\n\nH.Rishabraj Group is one of the leaders in reshaping the residential landscape, known for their outstanding projects and commitment to architectural excellence. Rishabraj Goregaon is a prime example of their dedication to creating exceptional living spaces that enhance everyday life. With a strong focus on quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction, they’ve built a solid reputation in the real estate industry.\n\nWhen you invest in a project by H Rishabraj Group, you can be confident in the quality of construction, timely delivery, and after-sales service.\n\n## Investment Potential\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali presents a compelling investment opportunity for several reasons:\n\n* **Prime Location:** The project's location at Borivali West, Mumbai ensures strong appreciation potential.\n* **Reputed Builder:** With H Rishabraj Group at the helm, quality and timely delivery are assured.\n* **Modern Amenities:** The comprehensive amenities package adds significant value to the property.\n* **RERA Approval:** RERA approved (PR1180002501316).\n* **Competitive Pricing:** The pricing offers good value compared to similar projects in the area.\n\n**Want investment analysis?** Get detailed ROI calculations and market comparison reports.\n\n### About This Project\n\n**Project:** Rishabraj Anuja Borivali\n\n**Location:** Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Developer:** H Rishabraj Group\n\n**Price:** ₹ 1.40 Cr - 2.93 Cr Onwards\n\n**Configurations:** 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 2 BHK + 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\n**RERA:** PR1180002501316\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Rishabraj Anuja Borivali\n\n### What is Rishabraj Anuja Borivali and where is it located?\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali is a premium residential development strategically located at Borivali West, Mumbai. Developed by H Rishabraj Group, this project offers modern living spaces and connectivity.\n\n### What is the price range and payment plan for Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?\n\nThe project offers competitive pricing starting from ₹ 1.40 Cr - 2.93 Cr Onwards. We offer flexible payment plans including construction-linked plans, subvention schemes, and bank financing options. Contact our sales team for detailed pricing.\n\n### Is Rishabraj Anuja Borivali RERA approved and legally compliant?\n\nYes, Rishabraj Anuja Borivali is RERA approved with registration number PR1180002501316.\n\n### What configurations are available in Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?\n\nThe project offers 4 different configurations: 1 BHK with carpet area of 435 – 455 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request, 2 BHK with carpet area of 660 – 726 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request, 2 BHK + 2 BHK with carpet area of On Request sq.ft. | Price: On Request, 3 BHK with carpet area of 935 sq.ft. sq.ft. | Price: On Request. Premium amenities include swimming pool, gymnasium, clubhouse, landscaped gardens, 24/7 security, power backup, and dedicated parking.\n\n### How is the location and connectivity of Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?\n\nLocated at Borivali West, Mumbai, the project enjoys excellent connectivity through: Proximity to major highways and expressways, Easy access to railway stations and metro lines, Close to reputed schools, colleges, and hospitals, Near shopping malls, entertainment centers, and business districts, Well-connected to Mumbai and other parts of Navi Mumbai.\n\n### What is the investment potential and expected ROI of Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali offers excellent investment potential with: High Appreciation: Located in a rapidly developing area with infrastructure growth, Rental Income: Strong rental demand due to proximity to IT parks and business centers, Developer Reputation: H Rishabraj Group has a track record of value appreciation, Future Development: Upcoming metro lines and infrastructure projects in the vicinity, Quality Construction: Premium construction ensures long-term value retention. Based on market analysis, properties in this micro-market have shown 8-12% annual appreciation over the past 5 years.\n\n### What is the current construction status and possession timeline?\n\nBased on the construction progress and developer's track record: Structure completion: Expected within 18-24 months, Finishing work: 6-8 months post structure completion, Final possession: Estimated 30-36 months from launch. RERA compliance ensures timely delivery.\n\n### What financing options and home loan facilities are available?\n\nWe offer comprehensive financing assistance through partnerships with leading banks and financial institutions: Home Loan Assistance: Tie-ups with SBI, HDFC, ICICI and other major banks, Competitive Interest Rates: Starting from 8.5% per annum, Flexible Payment Plans: Construction-linked, time-linked, and subvention schemes available, Loan Tenure: Up to 30 years with flexible EMI options, Quick Approval: In-principle approval within 48-72 hours, Documentation Support: Complete assistance with loan documentation and processing. Our dedicated finance team ensures smooth processing.\n\n### How does Rishabraj Anuja Borivali compare to other residential projects in Navi Mumbai?\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali stands out from competitors through: Prime Location: Better connectivity and infrastructure compared to similar projects, Competitive Pricing: 10-15% more affordable than comparable projects in the vicinity, Superior Amenities: More comprehensive lifestyle facilities, Trusted Developer: H Rishabraj Group has better delivery track record than many competitors, Investment Potential: Higher appreciation potential due to strategic location and development plans, Quality Construction: Premium materials and construction standards exceeding industry norms\n\n## Ready to Explore Rishabraj Anuja Borivali?\n\nGet detailed pricing, floor plans, and exclusive offers directly from our experts.\n\n### More New Projects in Mumbai\n\n##### Ramas IC Maitri Menorah\n\nIC Colony, Borivali West\n\nOn Request\n\nBy Ramas Realty\n\n[View Ramas IC Maitri Menorah Details](https://newprojectsonline.com/ramas-ic-maitri-menorah-borivali)\n\n##### Victory Stella Nestle Borivali\n\nI C Colony, Borivali West\n\nOn Request\n\nBy Victory Venture Developers\n\n[View Victory Stella Nestle Borivali Details](https://newprojectsonline.com/victory-stella-nestle-ic-colony-borivali-west)\n\n##### Mayfair Borivali west\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nOn Request\\*\n\nBy Mayfair Housing\n\n[View Mayfair Borivali west Details](https://newprojectsonline.com/mayfair-borivali-west)\n\n##### Masakin Questend Borivali\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2.45 Cr\\* Onwards\n\nBy M S Group\n\n[View Masakin Questend Borivali Details](https://newprojectsonline.com/masakin-questend-borivali-west)\n\n[View All Projects](https://newprojectsonline.com/new-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n![NewProjectsOnline.Com](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png)\n\n#### NewProjectsOnline.Com\n\nReal estate expert with 10+ years specializing in residential properties and market analysis in Navi Mumbai.\n\n![Properties Listed](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/newprojectonline/listed.svg)\n\n950\n\n+\n\n##### Projects Listed\n\n![Locations Covered](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/newprojectonline/location.svg)\n\n5\n\n+\n\n##### Locations Covered\n\n![Expert Agents](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/newprojectonline/agents.svg)\n\n1\n\n+\n\n##### Expert Agents\n\n![Properties Sold](https://newprojectsonline.com/assets/newprojectonline/sold.svg)\n\n90\n\n+\n\n##### Properties Sold\n\n### About Us\n\nWith an experience of 20+ years in the real estate sector, we assist people searching for home, or looking for investment, and provide them with options that fulfill their desire effectively. NewProjectsOnline.com serves major areas from Mumbai, Thane, Pune and Navi 