](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n![Parking Type](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Parking Type\n\n0.25 Acres\n\n9 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nDecember 2027\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n**Rishabraj Anuja Project Overview**\n\n* The project is spread across 0.25 acres of land in Borivali\n* Rishabraj Anuja has 1 high-rise tower of G+9 storeys\n* You can choose from 1BHK, 2BHK, and 3BHK flats in Borivali\n\n**Rishabraj Anuja Location**\n\nThe address of H. Rishabraj Group New Launch is located near Kastur Park, Borivali West, Mumbai.\n\n**The Rishabraj Anuja project in Borivali offers connectivity to:**\n\n* S.V. Road\n* Borivali Railway Station\n* Dr. S. Radhakrishnan International School\n* Shastri Nagar Bus Stop\n* Shimpoli Metro Station\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall\n\n**Carpet Area of Flats in Borivali**\n\nH Rishabraj Group Borivali  carpet area details are given below:\n\n* 1BHK - 454 Sq.ft\n* 2BHK - 660 - 726 Sq.ft\n* 3BHK - 935 Sq.ft\n\n**Indulge in Rishabraj Anuja Amenities**\n\nThere are 10+ amenities that you can enjoy at the Rishabraj Anuja Project.\n\n* Kids' Play Area\n* Cycling Track\n* Garden\n* Clubhouse\n* Jogging Track\n\n**Rishabraj Anuja Borivali Parking**\n\nYou will get parking on the ground level of the Rishabraj Anuja Tower in Borivali .\n\n**Rishabraj Anuja Rera Number & Possession**\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali RERA possession is in December 2027, and the RERA number of Rishabraj Anuja is PR1180002501316.\n\n**Why invest in the Rishabraj Anuja property in Borivali ?**\n\n* Proximity to Borivali Railway Station\n* Fully Equipped Gymnasium\n* Good Safety & Security\n* Easy Access to Basic Facilities\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nRishabraj Anuja brochure\n\n## Pricing of Rishabraj Anuja\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [1 BHK Apartment](#tabs-3)\n* [2 BHK Apartment](#tabs-5)\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n\n* [454 sqft](#tabs-30383)\n\n![1 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n1 BHK | Carpet Area: 454 sqft | Price:\n\n* [660 sqft](#tabs-30384)\n* [683 sqft](#tabs-30385)\n* [689 sqft](#tabs-30386)\n* [726 sqft](#tabs-30387)\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 660 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.10 Cr\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 683 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.17 Cr\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 689 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.19 Cr\n\n![2 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n2 BHK | Carpet Area: 726 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.30 Cr\n\n* [935 sqft](#tabs-30388)\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 935 sqft | Price:  ₹ 2.93 Cr\n\n## Property Features of Rishabraj Anuja\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp) Jogging Track\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp) Kids Play Area\n\n* ![Yoga Zone](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/COwM5RjENyf7U7nEW3taZHaXwLNwUKHFpeE88skI.webp) Yoga Zone\n\n* ![Fitness Corner](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/kkrjvuNiSx4H88OQQXbAfaqA1zYX