T INTERNATIONAL TODDLER TECH PRE SCHOOL\n* M.J. Junior College\n* Gokhale Educational Society's\n\n**Hospitals in Borivali West**\n\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital in Borivali\n* Lotus Superspeciality Hospital\n* Sohum Eye Care Centre | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospitals PVT.LTD.\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Borivali West**\n\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali West\n* Reliance Mall\n* ZUDIO – Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Borivali\n\n## About H Rishabraj Group\n\n![H Rishabraj Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/9mPKsUSFdvYA1DJ49wHoyhxTjOPInk3lFcitUIOC.png)\n\n* Year Estd. 2009\n* [Projects - 8](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/h-rishabraj-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### H Rishabraj Group\n\nH.Rishabraj Group is one of the leaders in reshaping the residential landscape, known for their outstanding projects and commitment to architectural excellence. Rishabraj\n\nread more\n\nGoregaon is a prime example of their dedication to creating exceptional living spaces that enhance everyday life. With a strong focus on quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction, they’ve built a solid reputation in the real estate industry.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of Rishabraj Anuja\n\n![PR1180002501316.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/OScZYE13q0pkJeFZbDJRKpMzB1DIa3DNzHWgbQvD.webp) PR1180002501316\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Rishabraj Anuja\n\nWhat is the address of Rishabraj Anuja?\n\nThe Rishabraj Anuja is located at Boriwali West Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Rishabraj Anuja?\n\nRishabraj Anuja Borivali West RERA number is PR1180002501316.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Rishabraj Anuja Borivali West?\n\nRishabraj Anuja offers premium 1,2,3 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Borivali West.\n\nWhat is the 